# External Swift packages vendored under vendor/ — managed by scripts/vendor.py.
#
#   DIR   directory under vendor/; must equal the upstream repository name so the
#         SwiftPM package identity is unchanged (product references use it)
#   URL   upstream git repository
#   REF   pinned tag or commit
#   options
#     binaries=A,B   binaryTarget names to keep; SwiftPM fetches each zip and
#                    verifies the upstream SHA-256 (unlisted ones are removed)
#     drop=X,Y       package identities to strip, together with the targets
#                    that use them (things this project never builds)
#
# Bump a pin with `./scripts/vendor.py update DIR REF`; `status` lists newer tags.

# DIR                            URL                                                         REF        options
ghosttykit-rootshell             https://github.com/kitknox/ghosttykit-rootshell.git         v0.2.12    binaries=GhosttyKitAppStore
ios_system-rootshell             https://github.com/kitknox/ios_system-rootshell.git         v0.1.0     binaries=ios_system,awk,files,shell,text
Citadel-rootshell                https://github.com/kitknox/Citadel-rootshell.git            0.12.4     drop=ColorizeSwift
swift-nio-ssh-rootshell          https://github.com/kitknox/swift-nio-ssh-rootshell.git      0.1.2      drop=swift-docc-plugin
BigInt                           https://github.com/attaswift/BigInt.git                     v5.7.0
swift-asn1                       https://github.com/apple/swift-asn1.git                     1.7.2
swift-atomics                    https://github.com/apple/swift-atomics.git                  1.3.1
swift-collections                https://github.com/apple/swift-collections.git              1.6.0
swift-crypto                     https://github.com/apple/swift-crypto.git                   3.15.1
swift-log                        https://github.com/apple/swift-log.git                      1.15.0
